WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.349
P4.1 · Budgets: drivers, import from Claude, conversion to cash

2
00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:14.460
A K-φ budget is driver-based: gross profit, EBITDA and net income are computed, never typed.

3
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:19.750
The categories are fixed for every client; what sits under each one is the client's own.

4
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:26.127
Give the spreadsheet to Claude through the K-φ connector, or to the Consultant in the app.

5
00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:31.643
Each line is mapped to its category, the detail kept underneath; every write is logged.

6
00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:37.347
On the Flow Rules tab, Generate rules gives each category its timing.

7
00:00:37.397 --> 00:00:41.118
Then the budget's cash flows feed the forecast after the cutoff.

8
00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:47.773
Next: P4.2  Ledger or open invoices

